{%- comment -%}
  Shared closing chrome for the non-homepage templates. Closes the
  .sajda-shell wrapper opened in snippets/sajda-head.liquid, then renders the
  same footer the landing page uses — outside the shell, so the shell's
  palette cannot repaint it.

  The footer carries the product disclaimer, because these pages are
  reachable straight from search and from the footer, so the disclaimer must
  not depend on the visitor having seen the homepage first.

  Nothing here hardcodes a contact address any more: this footer once
  published a different company's support address and domain on every page of
  this site except the homepage, alongside expired discount codes and a
  disclaimer written for a different product. It all comes from theme
  settings now.
{%- endcomment -%}
</div>{%- comment -%} /.sajda-shell {%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'jw-footer' %}
